=base:summary.cmark

An in-browser playground for [tramaj](https://github.com/lucasdicioccio/tramaj)
— formerly "templating-lang" — the expression/document language behind
[`.tramaj-json` and `.tramaj-doc` sections](/sections-templating.html),
hosted directly on this site.

=base:main-content.cmark

This is the same playground built from the
[tramaj](https://github.com/lucasdicioccio/tramaj) repository's PureScript
sources, published here as a static bundle so it can be tried without a local
build. It parses and evaluates tramaj expressions and documents in the
browser — nothing is sent to a server.

See [Tramaj sections](/sections-templating.html) for how the same language is
embedded server-side, as a section pre-processor, by KitchenSink itself.

<iframe class="playground-frame" src="/templating-playground.html" title="tramaj playground"></iframe>

If the embedded frame does not load, open the
[playground](/templating-playground.html) directly.
